# openai/whisper-large-v3 - seq2seq ASR full fine-tune on LibriSpeech (measured: see README results table)
# NOTE (measured, unresolved): on this VM's transformers==5.18.0, this exact recipe REGRESSES WER
# (2.25% -> 3.34% at 500 steps on the full train set) instead of improving it, despite passing both
# a label-correctness check and a 0-step/lr=0 harness control. See chapter 03 and EVIDENCE.md.
MODEL=models/whisper-large-v3
DATASET=data/librispeech/manifests/train_full.jsonl
OUTPUT_DIR=runs/whisper-large-v3
MODEL_KIND=seq2seq
ADAPTER=
: "${LR:=1e-5}"
: "${BATCH:=4}"
